	measure '% Mosaic Exams Last N Days' = ```
			
			VAR daysback = [selecteddays]
			VAR MosaicExamsInRange =
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUM('Daily_Extract'[Exam Ct]),
			        FILTER( 'Daily_Extract', (isblank(daysback) ||
			            
			           ( 'Daily_Extract'[Date] >= today() - (daysback -1) &&
			            'Daily_Extract'[Date] <= Today() ))
			            && 'Daily_Extract'[Mosaic Exam Flag] =1
			        )
			    )
			VAR TotalMosaicExams =
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUM('Daily_Extract'[Exam Ct]), 
			        filter ('Daily_Extract', isblank(daysback) ||
			        ('Daily_Extract'[Date] >= today() - (daysback -1) &&
			            'Daily_Extract'[Date] <= Today() ))
			      
			    )
			RETURN
			    if ( isblank(daysback), blank(),
			    divide ( mosaicexamsinrange, totalmosaicexams ,0))
			```
		formatString: 0%;-0%;0%
		lineageTag: afac5062-d64b-4bd0-ba20-08bb4e7d12b4

